<title>USA: Warner-Lambert files trade-secrets suit.</title>
<headline>Warner-Lambert files trade-secrets suit.</headline>
<dateline>MORRIS PLAINS, N.J. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warner-Lambert Co. said on Monday it had filed a lawsuit alleging Copley Pharmaceutical Inc of illegally receiving trade secrets from a former Warner-Lambert employee.</p>
<p>The suit, filed in Morris County, N.J., alleges Copley of inducing Shuba Chungi to reveal information about Warner-Lambert's anti-arrthmyia drug PROCAN SR after Copley hired Chungi away from Warner-Lambert.</p>
<p>Copley then used the information to develop its own version of PROCAN SR, the suit alleges.</p>
<p>Copley officials could not be reached late Monday for comment.</p>
</text>
